  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UTP: Support to Ukraine Energy Support Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to enable Ukrainian energy utility companies to provide citizens with energy, based on a restored functioning of the energy infrastructure. This will contribute to creating and sustaining livelihoods for Ukrainian citizens through the re-establishment of the necessary basic energy infrastructure and supply.</narrative>
